The plan in .agents/plans/M4.md is approved with these corrections. Implement all of M4 now.

1. End-to-end test must be planner-driven, like the M3 scenario tests: after streaming the scenario's OBD observations, repeatedly take the top runnable test from GET /state (not a hard-coded test id), answer it from the scenario fixture via the result route, until the stop rule fires or 4 tests. Parametrize over all 7 sim scenarios (L1, tools=[]); each final report must name the true hypothesis #1 with p >= 0.8 and validate against packages/schemas/report.json. Also test that WS pushes equal GET state after every event, and that a WS client that reconnects mid-session gets the current state.
2. VIN, per AGENTS.md: store it encrypted at rest (key from a new MMC_VIN_KEY env var; add it to .env.example with no value, and generate a dev key automatically into DATA_DIR if unset), index by sha256, and only ever display or log the last 6 characters. Test that no full VIN appears in the event log file, server logs or the report JSON.
3. Include the blob upload route the Android client uses for .mmrec, written through store/blobs.py, and list it in AGENTS.md API contracts if it isn't there.
4. docs/SAFETY.md checklist: assume the owner works alone. Vehicle in Park/Neutral with the parking brake set, outdoors only (never in a garage), phone mounted and logging started before any rpm hold, never touch the phone while holding rpm, no hands near belts or fans, abort conditions as planned. Include the M2 real-vehicle acceptance items (VIN, DTCs and at least 10 PIDs logged to a .mmrec bundle over Classic) and how to copy the .mmrec off the phone (adb pull path) into backend/tests/fixtures/sessions/.
5. Android: debug build must point at the backend over Tailscale by default; take the host from a gradle property MMC_BACKEND_URL with a sensible default, editable in the settings screen. Keep Sim selectable so the full flow runs on the phone with no car.
6. Do not commit.

Order as planned; keep tests green after each step. At the end run:
  cd backend && uv run pytest -q
  cd android && ./gradlew testDebugUnitTest assembleDebug
  scripts/replay_check.sh backend/tests/fixtures/sessions/*.mmrec
and fix failures until all pass. Add a dated docs/DECISIONS.md entry. Finish with files created/changed, test counts, the per-scenario e2e results, and the pass/fail of each command.
